@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Registrar usuario comprador
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Braulio Levio",
  "email": "braulio@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "rol": "COMPRADOR"
}

### Registrar usuario staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Staff Test",
  "email": "staff@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "rol": "STAFF"
}


### Login correcto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "braulio@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta (debe dar error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "braulio@test.com",
  "password": "clave-mala"
}

### Registrar con email duplicado (debe dar error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Otro Braulio",
  "email": "braulio@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "rol": "COMPRADOR"
}

### Buscar usuario por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/usuarios/1